### 4. src/consensus/zbft/contract_create.cc
关键逻辑（block_tx.status() == kConsensusSuccess 分支内）：
```cpp
// MergeToPrev 前检测 CrossShardBase
std::string xsb_runtime_code;
{
    evmc::address new_addr_evmc = sethvm::StrToEvmcAddr(block_tx.to());
    evmc::bytes32 sentinel = seth_host.get_storage(new_addr_evmc, sethvm::kIsCrossShardBaseSlot);
    if (sentinel.bytes[31] == 1) {
        auto c2_it = seth_host.create2_accounts_.find(new_addr_evmc);
        if (c2_it != seth_host.create2_accounts_.end() && !c2_it->second.code.empty()) {
            xsb_runtime_code = std::string(c2_it->second.code.begin(), c2_it->second.code.end());
        }
    }
}
// MergeToPrev 后，在正常创建项 to_item_ptr 上附加 runtime_bytecode
if (!xsb_runtime_code.empty()) {
    to_item_ptr->set_runtime_bytecode(xsb_runtime_code);
}
```
不再生成单独的 `__xsb_deploy__` 广播项。

### 5. src/consensus/zbft/root_to_tx_item.cc
删除旧的 `des_sharding_id==0` fan-out 块。
在正常成功路径中：
```cpp
if (!to_item.runtime_bytecode().empty()) {
    // CrossShardBase creation: fan out to all shards
    for (uint32_t s = kConsensusShardBeginNetworkId; s <= max_sharding_id_; ++s) {
        std::string fan_key = to_item.des() + std::to_string(s);
        auto copy = std::make_shared<...>(to_item);
        copy->set_des_sharding_id(s);
        seth_host.cross_to_map_[fan_key] = copy;
    }
} else {
    // 普通单分片路由（原逻辑）
    ...
}
```

用户说明：root 分片不应存储合约 bytecode，只负责路由/fan-out。

### 6. src/consensus/zbft/to_tx_local_item.cc
```cpp
// has_base_root_address → 跨分片调用（transfer/storage），直接走 HandleCrossShardBase
if (to_tx_item.has_base_root_address()) {
    HandleCrossShardBase(...);
    return;
}
// ...new_addr_func 处理账号...
// early-return 条件加 runtime_bytecode 检查
if (amount <= 0 && library_bytes().empty() && runtime_bytecode().empty()) {
    return;
}
// ...
// CrossShardBase 创建：存 bytecode 到本地全局 KV
if (!to_tx_item.runtime_bytecode().empty()) {
    const std::string sys_str(kCrossShardSystemExecutor.bytes, 20);
    seth_host.SaveKeyValue(sys_str, "xsb:" + addr, to_tx_item.runtime_bytecode());
}
```

HandleCrossShardBase：
```cpp
// 从 KV 读取 bytecode（不从跨分片 TX 消息中获取）
std::string bytecode;
seth_host.GetKeyValue(sys_str, "xsb:" + base_raw, &bytecode);
if (bytecode.empty()) {
    SETH_ERROR("bytecode not in registry for base=%s", ...);
    return;
}
// 懒部署分身合约...
```

